(text "LM51772 - programmable 5-20 V / 100 W" (at 12 15 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54)) (justify left top)) (uuid "8f49020d-0c6d-5711-b3ab-bd0882da1f1a"))
(text "WEBENCH Design103 adapted for I2C (ADDR=GND, address 0x6A), internal feedback and MCU enable/reset.\nAPS1040M2R2A replaces 1.8 uH. Compensation and current limit require recalculation/testing before power-up.\nAll bridge FETs standardized to CSD17577Q3A (30 V). Not an EPR design. Maximum contract 20 V / 5 A." (at 12 23 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "05468cc5-8c4c-53fb-ab47-85f5cd9af718"))
